  "notes": "Dark: torches and lamps, daylight at the adit by day. Timbered adit with tram rails up into the ore chamber (tin lodes, ore carts, the old stope, the last shift's tally board, a rat run). Planked vent drift west to the woods with moss and a timber crib. Winze gallery east: deep water round the ladder shaft down to the Deep Level [L]; powder kegs in the niche beyond. Round 8 (8K): timber sets with lagging along the vent drift, at the chamber mouths and at the winze (its torch hangs on the set); a lamp post in the chamber, crates under the tally board, an ore pile and a wheelbarrow by the ore cart, rock falls, rope by the drift, a crate by the powder; the adit torch on the rock beside the mouth.",
